From 96a6834740d049134bfb1c17bb726cfd1a732e2d Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Liew Rui Yan <aethernet65535@gmail.com>
Date: Tue, 1 Sep 2026 08:57:53 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] mm/damon/core: always return false while quota->esz is zero

After setting goal_tuner to 'temporal', if the goal is satisfied,
quota->esz will be set to zero.  In this case, damos_quota_is_full()
will always return 'true', even if no regions have been tried at all.

Fix it by always return 'false' while quota->esz is zero.

Signed-off-by: Liew Rui Yan <aethernet65535@gmail.com>
---
 mm/damon/core.c | 2 ++
 1 file changed, 2 insertions(+)

diff --git a/mm/damon/core.c b/mm/damon/core.c
index 644daf5a1656..c9f220f2c2f6 100644
--- a/mm/damon/core.c
+++ b/mm/damon/core.c
@@ -2560,6 +2560,8 @@ static bool damos_quota_is_full(struct damos_quota *quota,
 {
 	if (!damos_quota_is_set(quota))
 		return false;
+	if (!quota->esz)
+		return true;
 	if (quota->charged_sz >= quota->esz)
 		return true;
 	/*
-- 
